      "ipip_V339": "Am considered to be a wise person.",
      "ipip_V192": "Am not good at figuring out what really matters.",
      "ipip_V262": "Am rarely consulted for advice by others.",
      "ipip_V288": "Consider myself to be a wise person.",
      "ipip_V8": "Have a broad outlook on what is going on.",
      "ipip_V81": "Have an excellent view of the world.",
      "ipip_V44": "Lose sight of what is most important in life.",
      "ipip_V96": "Am good at helping people work well together.",
      "ipip_V135": "Am not good at planning group activities.",
      "ipip_V105": "Am not good at taking charge of a group.",
      "ipip_V239": "Am told that I am a strong but fair leader.",
      "ipip_V54": "Have difficulty getting others to work together.",
      "ipip_V274": "Try to make my group members happy.",
      "ipip_V35": "Try to make sure everyone in a group feels included.",
      "ipip_H686": "Am hard to understand.",
      "ipip_V196": "Am true to my own values.",
      "ipip_V10": "Am trusted to keep secrets.",
      "ipip_V86": "Believe that honesty is the basis for trust.",
      "ipip_V163": "Can be trusted to keep my promises.",
      "ipip_V238": "Feel like an imposter.",
      "ipip_H149": "Keep my promises.",
      "ipip_V143": "Lie to get myself out of trouble.",
      "ipip_V305": "Like to exaggerate my troubles.",
      "ipip_V179": "Am proud that I am an ordinary person.",
      "ipip_V42": "Believe that others are drawn to me because I am humble.",
      "ipip_V145": "Don't brag about my accomplishments.",
      "ipip_V249": "Don't call attention to myself.",
      "ipip_V68": "Like to stand out in a crowd.",
      "ipip_V214": "Like to talk about myself.",
      "ipip_V321": "Would never be described as arrogant.",
      "ipip_V278": "Am in awe of simple things in life that others might take for granted.",
      "ipip_V243": "Appreciate all forms of art.",
      "ipip_V60": "Can become tearful thinking of the goodness of others.",
      "ipip_V316": "Crave the experience of great art.",
      "ipip_V102": "Experience deep emotions when I see beautiful things.",
      "ipip_V52": "Feel it's important to live in a world of beauty.",
      "ipip_V174": "Have been left speechless by the beauty depicted in a movie.",
      "ipip_V24": "Am never too busy to help a friend.",
      "ipip_V195": "Am only kind to others if they have been kind to me.",
      "ipip_V272": "Call my friends when they are sick.",
      "ipip_V233": "Get as excited about the good fortunes of others as I am about my own.",
      "ipip_V6": "Get impatient when others talk to me about their problems.",
      "ipip_V88": "Go out of my way to cheer up people who appear down.",
      "ipip_V164": "Helped a neighbor in the last month.",
      "ipip_V303": "Love to let others share the spotlight.",
      "ipip_V129": "Love to make other people happy.",
      "ipip_V40": "Try not to do favors for others.",
      "ipip_V281": "Am not confident that my way of doing things will work out for the best.",
      "ipip_V65": "Can find the positive in what seems negative to others.",
      "ipip_V36": "Expect the worst.",
      "ipip_V206": "Have no plan for my life five years from now.",
      "ipip_V28": "Look on the bright side.",
      "ipip_V106": "Remain hopeful despite challenges.",
      "ipip_V317": "Think about what is good in my life when I feel down.",
      "ipip_V246": "Will succeed with the goals I set for myself.",
      "ipip_V76": "Am not fun to be with.",
